        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion SA-A2, Tubular Stainless Steel Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple tubular stainless steel lever is made in contemporary design, using clean lines. It is available in brushed stainless steel and polished stainless steel finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion SA-A2 Simple Stainless Steel Lever With Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Simple SA-A2 Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length:  5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection:  2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter:  2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Stainless Steel Leverset, Fusion SA-A2",
                "description": "Tubular Stainless Steel Leverset Fusion SA-A2 - This simple tubular stainless steel lever is made in contemporary design, using clean lines. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
